    "title": "City Settles PAC Lawsuit, Will Pay $27,000 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bob Hembree, Lake Powell Chronicle ,\n7 hours ago The Page City Council approved a settlement agreement Oct. 8 to pay $27,000 in legal fees to the Page Action Committee (PAC) and ask the court to place a citizen initiative on the Nov. 2026 ballot, ending a legal battle over Lake Powell Boulevard that reached the Arizona Supreme Court. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
